(7694499, 1261251, 38162, '<td valign="top">I gave this Jerseyside image a 10. I sure dont see this as a shoehorn entry. Big difference between symbolism and just trying to sell it with a clever title. Sadly today a large percentage of folks disparage the symbolism of Lady Liberty and have perverted such language as freedom on their slippery-slope quest of ditching democracy all together. <br/>Thanks for a fine reminder here of how tenuous is our grip on cultural values today.</td>', 'I gave this Jerseyside image a 10. I sure dont see this as a shoehorn entry. Big difference between symbolism and just trying to sell it with a clever title. Sadly today a large percentage of folks disparage the symbolism of Lady Liberty and have perverted such language as freedom on their slippery-slope quest of ditching democracy all together. Thanks for a fine reminder here of how tenuous is our grip on cultural values today.', '2021-05-18 17:37:34.000000', NULL, 0);
